      "description": "Town NPC Spawn Initializer (20 Variants): if +$66==0 branches directly to active NPC tick 0x018538; for +$66 in 1..20 configures entity height +$4A, animation +$2A, facing +$16, collision/render flags (+$36, +$37, +$38, +$3C, +$3D), patrol bounding box (xmin, ymin, xmax, ymax) at +$A6..+$AC, and dialog ID at +$A0 gated by story flags $FF0DBF:0, $FF0DBC:0, and $FF0DC5:3; common epilogue 0x018526 saves variant ID +$66 to +$9E, clears +$66=0 and timer +$2=0."
    }
